CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/be com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/PlacementRuleSet
	COMMENT All [placementRule_*] blocks of a custom unit. Fields: groups (the distinct anyRuleInGroup CustomTags, list order kept), rules (all parsed PlacementRules), hasBlockingRuleWithoutCheckEachTile / hasBlockingRuleWithCheckEachTile (fast-path flags set while parsing) and the shared static geoIndex (PlacementGeoIndex) used for the unit geo query. a(meta, ini) parses every "placementRule_" section (returning null when there are none and warning "[placementRule_X]anyRuleInGroup: No other rule with this same group name found" for a group with a single rule); a(unit,x,y)/a(unit,tileX,tileY) test placement and return the cannotPlaceMessage of the first blocking rule, or null when allowed.
	FIELD a groups Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/utility/m;
	FIELD b rules Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/utility/m;
	FIELD c hasBlockingRuleWithoutCheckEachTile Z
	FIELD d hasBlockingRuleWithCheckEachTile Z
	FIELD e geoIndex Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/bf;
